}

ctx.stroke();
```

3. Modify event listeners to add a wireframe line.

- In the `canvas.addEventListener('mouseup', (event) => {...})` event, update the part that pushes new vertices and edges. Replace this part:

```javascript
vertices.push([startX.toPrecision(4), startY.toPrecision(4), startZ], [endX.toPrecision(4), endY.toPrecision(4), endZ]);
