3. Create "templates" and "static" directories in the same folder as "main.py";
4. Save the HTML template in "templates/index.html";
5. Save the JavaScript file in "static/client.js";
6. Start the server by running the command: `uvicorn main:app --reload`;
7. Open your web browser and go to `http://localhost:8000`.

