这个示例代码使用DirectXTex库中的LoadFromWICFile函数加载一张png格式的图片为内存中的ScratchImage对象。接着使用CreateShaderResourceView函数创建2D纹理的着色器视图并赋值给了全局变量g_pSRV，表示这是一个2D纹理资源的共享视图。

注意，这里的直接设备是在使用DirectX 11的情况下创建的，并且使用了对应版本的DirectXTex库。如果使用的是其他版本的DirectX或者DirectXTex库，那么必须根据实际情况来调整代码。

下面是一个使用DirectXTex库中的CreateTextureEx函数创建2D纹理的示例代码：

```C++
#include <DirectXTex.h>
#include <d3d11.h>

ID3D11ShaderResourceView* g_pSRV = NULL;

HRESULT CreateTextureFromMemory(ID3D11Device* pDevice, BYTE* pData, UINT size)
{
    DirectX::TexMetadata metadata;
    DirectX::ScratchImage image;
    HRESULT hr = DirectX::LoadFromDDSMemory(pData, size, DirectX::DDS_FLAGS_NONE, &metadata, image);

    if (FAILED(hr))
    {
        return hr;
    }

    ID3D11Texture2D* pTexture = nullptr;
    hr = DirectX::CreateTextureEx(pDevice, image.GetImages(), image.GetImageCount(), metadata,
        D3D11_USAGE_DEFAULT, D3D11_BIND_SHADER_RESOURCE, 0, 0,
        DirectX::TEX_FILTER_DEFAULT, DirectX::TEX_DIMENSION_TEXTURE2D, &pTexture);

    if (SUCCEEDED(hr))
    {
        D3D11_SHADER_RESOURCE_VIEW_DESC srvDesc = {};
        srvDesc.Format = metadata.format;
        srvDesc.ViewDimension = D3D11_SRV_DIMENSION_TEXTURE2D;
        srvDesc.Texture2D.MipLevels = metadata.mipLevels;

        hr = pDevice->CreateShaderResourceView(pTexture, &srvDesc, &g_pSRV);

        if (FAILED(hr))
        {
            pTexture->Release();
            Cleanup();
            return hr;
        }

        pTexture->Release();
    }

    return S_OK;
}

void Cleanup()
{
    if (g_pSRV != NULL)
    {
        g_pSRV->Release();
        g_pSRV = NULL;
    }
}

int main()
{
    // 创建DirectX设备
    ID3D11Device* pDevice = nullptr;
    HRESULT hr = D3D11CreateDevice(nullptr, D3D_DRIVER_TYPE_HARDWARE, nullptr, 0, nullptr, 0, D3D11_SDK_VERSION, &pDevice, nullptr, nullptr);
    if (FAILED(hr))
    {
        return 1;
    }

    // 读取DDS文件，创建纹理
    BYTE* pData = nullptr;
    UINT size = 0;
    hr = ReadDataFromFile(L"example.dds", &pData, &size);
    if (FAILED(hr))
    {
        pDevice->Release();
        Cleanup();
        return 1;
    }

    hr = CreateTextureFromMemory(pDevice, pData, size);
    if (FAILED(hr))
    {
        pDevice->Release();
        Cleanup();
        return 1;
    }

    // 渲染代码

    // 清除资源
    pDevice->Release();
    Cleanup();
    return 0;
}
```

这个示例代码使用DirectXTex库中的LoadFromDDSMemory函数从内存中的DDS文件读取了图像数据，并使用CreateTextureEx函数创建了一个2D纹理。在使用CreateTextureEx函数时，传递相应的参数指定使用的设备、图像数据、元数据以及相关选项来选择纹理创建的方法。最后，这个示例代码创建了一个着色器资源视图并将其赋值给了全局变量g_pSRV，以供渲染使用。最后，使用Cleanup函数清除与创建纹理相关的资源。

To resize a video in React Native using Expo, you can utilize the `react-native-video` library for displaying video and the `expo-av` library for manipulating the video. Here is a basic step-by-step guide to get you started:

1. First, make sure you have Expo installed. If you don't, you can install it globally by running `npm install -g expo-cli`.

2. Create a new Expo project by running `expo init YourProjectName`.

3. Switch to your project directory by running `cd YourProjectName`.

4. Install the required packages:

   ```
   expo install expo-av
   expo install expo-media-library
   expo install expo-permissions
   ```

5. Now, open your `App.js` file and modify it:

```javascript
import React, { useState } from "react";
import { View, StyleSheet, TouchableOpacity, Alert, Text } from "react-native";
import { Video } from "expo-av";
import * as MediaLibrary from "expo-media-library";
import * as Permissions from "expo-permissions";

export default function App() {
  const [videoSaved, setVideoSaved] = useState(false);

  const saveVideoToStorage = async (videoUri) => {
    try {
      const { status } = await Permissions.askAsync(Permissions.MEDIA_LIBRARY);
      if (status === "granted") {
        const savedVideoAsset = await MediaLibrary.createAssetAsync(videoUri);
        setVideoSaved(true);

        Alert.alert("Success!", "Video saved to storage.");
      } else {
        Alert.alert("Error", "Permission not granted.");
      }
    } catch (error) {
      console.error("Error saving video:", error);
    }
  };

  return (
    <View style={styles.container}>
      <Video
        source={{
          uri: "https://file-examples-com.github.io/uploads/2017/04/file_example_MP4_480_1_5MG.mp4",
        }}
        rate={1.0}
        volume={1.0}
        isMuted={false}
        resizeMode="cover"
        shouldPlay
        isLooping
        style={styles.video}
      />
      {!videoSaved && (
        <TouchableOpacity
          style={styles.button}
          onPress={() =>
            saveVideoToStorage(
              "https://file-examples-com.github.io/uploads/2017/04/file_example_MP4_480_1_5MG.mp4"
            )
          }
        >
          <Text style={styles.buttonText}>Save Video to Storage</Text>
        </TouchableOpacity>
      )}
    </View>
  );
}

const styles = StyleSheet.create({
