Note that the `ChromeOptions.CAPABILITY` is used to set the Chrome options capability itself. By setting it to `true`, we indicate that we want to use Chrome options. Alternatively, you can set it to `false` if you don't want to use any Chrome options.

In Selenium 3, `options.setCapability(ChromeOptions.CAPABILITY, options);` is used to add the Chrome options to the `DesiredCapabilities` object.

