            if (object.HasMember(componentName.c_str())) {
                const auto &componentData = object[componentName.c_str()];
                // Create/typecast the component based on its type and load its data from the JSON object
                assert(componentData.IsObject());
            }
        }
        // In this loop, you can create instances of your components and add them to the object
    }
}
```

6. Populate your `allComponentNames` list with all possible component names.
7. Pass the JSON scene file containing the objects and their components to the `load_scene()` function.

