在 Axum 中，可以使用内置的 `WithRequestParts` middleware 来将请求 ID 存储为请求扩展。

下面是一个示例，展示如何使用 `WithRequestParts` 来存储请求 ID：

```rust
use axum::{
    extract::{Extension, RequestParts},
    handler::get,
    http::StatusCode,
    response::{IntoResponse, Html},
    AddExtensionLayer, Router,
};
use std::sync::Arc;
use tower_http::trace::{DefaultMakeSpan, TraceLayer};

struct RequestIdGenerator;

impl RequestIdGenerator {
    fn new() -> Self {
        Self
    }

    fn generate_id(&self) -> String {
        uuid::Uuid::new_v4().to_string()
    }
}

async fn handler(request_id: Extension<Arc<String>>) -> impl IntoResponse {
    Html(format!(
        "<h1>Hello, world!</h1><p>Request ID: {}</p>",
        request_id.as_ref()
    ))
    .with_status(StatusCode::OK)
    .into_response()
}

#[tokio::main]
async fn main() {
    tracing_subscriber::fmt::init();
    let app = Router::new().route("/", get(handler));
    let request_id_generator = Arc::new(RequestIdGenerator::new());
    let trace_layer = TraceLayer::<_, _, _, DefaultMakeSpan>::new().make_span_with(move |req| {
        tracing::info_span!(
            "span",
            method = %req.method(),
            path = %req.uri(),
            request_id = %request_id_generator.generate_id(),
        )
    });

    let middleware = RequestParts::<()>::default()
        .on_pre_routing(|mut request_parts| {
            let request_id = Arc::new(
                request_parts
                    .extensions_mut()
                    .insert(request_id_generator.generate_id()),
            );
            request_parts.extensions_mut().insert(request_id);
            async move { request_parts }
        })
        .on_response(|response, parts| async move {
            if let Some(request_id) = parts.extensions().get::<Arc<String>>() {
                tracing::info!(
                    "response sent with id: {}",
                    request_id.as_str()
                );
            }
            response
        });
    let app = middleware
        .layer(AddExtensionLayer::new(request_id_generator))
        .layer(trace_layer)
        .clone()
        .boxed()
        .combine(app)
        .boxed();

    axum::Server::bind(&"0.0.0.0:3000".parse().unwrap())
        .serve(app.into_make_service())
        .await
        .unwrap();
}
```

在这个例子中，我们首先定义了一个 `RequestIdGenerator` 结构体，用于生成唯一的请求 ID。在中间件中，我们将请求 ID 存储为 Arc<String> 类型，并将其添加到请求的扩展中，以确保其在整个处理过程中一直存在。

