This rule checks whether the user's `role` field is set to "admin" before allowing them to read or write the `"adminOnly"` node.

Note that hard-coding an admin email may not be the most secure or scalable solution, especially if you need to add more admins later. In that case, you might want to consider a more flexible solution where admins can be added dynamically and their email addresses are stored in a Firebase database or configuration file.

