In this example, `initialize_waitqueue` initializes the waitqueue (binary semaphore), `wait_in_waitqueue` blocks the current task until signaled, and `signal_waitqueue` signals the waitqueue to unblock a waiting task if any.

Remember to handle synchronization carefully using task notifications, semaphores, or other FreeRTOS synchronization mechanisms that best fit your use case and requirements.

