The exception `java.lang.IllegalStateException: RedisRateLimiter is not initialized` is thrown when you try to use the `RedisRateLimiter` without properly initializing it. 

To fix this issue, you need to initialize the `RedisRateLimiter` by providing it with a valid `ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory` bean. Here's an example of how you can initialize the `RedisRateLimiter` bean:

```java
import org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.Autowired;
import org.springframework.context.annotation.Bean;
import org.springframework.context.annotation.Configuration;
import org.springframework.data.redis.connection.ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory;
import org.springframework.data.redis.core.ReactiveStringRedisTemplate;
import org.springframework.data.redis.support.atomic.RedisAtomicInteger;
import reactor.core.publisher.Mono;

@Configuration
public class RedisConfig {

    @Autowired
    private ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory redisConnectionFactory;

    @Autowired
    private ReactiveStringRedisTemplate redisTemplate;

    @Bean
    public RedisRateLimiter redisRateLimiter() {
        int replenishRate = 10;
        int burstCapacity = 10;

        RedisRateLimiter.Config config = new RedisRateLimiter.Config()
                .withReplenishRate(replenishRate)
                .withBurstCapacity(burstCapacity);

        RedisRateLimiter redisRateLimiter = new RedisRateLimiter(redisConnectionFactory, config);
        // Initialize the RedisRateLimiter
        redisRateLimiter.setReactiveStringRedisTemplate(redisTemplate);
        redisRateLimiter.setReactiveAtomicCounter(redisTemplate, "rate-limiter-counter");

        // Warm up the RedisRateLimiter
        return redisRateLimiter.warmup()
                .doOnSuccess(aVoid -> System.out.println("RedisRateLimiter initialized"))
                .thenReturn(redisRateLimiter)
                .block();
    }

    // Other Redis-related beans and configuration
}
```

Ensure that you have a valid `ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory` bean defined in your configuration or import the necessary Redis configuration.

